00448, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 103, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_a1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_a1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 34.925, "size_bytes": 210528, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 103, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 30.625, "size_bytes": 184752, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 103, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 32.5, "size_bytes": 195984, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 103, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@1fa389e/content/data/versions/901.json", "paragraphs": ["The reporter wanted an iPhone 17 Pro, AirPods Pro 3, tissues and nuts. He asked three AI helpers for the cheapest shop and price.", "The AI helpers gave real prices. But some shops sold used or opened iPhones. One helper sent him to a shop that did not sell in his city.", "A new AI called Lingguang watched prices for him. It sent a message when the iPhone price fell to about 7259 yuan.", "The reporter said AI can save money. But AI must also say what kind of product it finds."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这位记者想买iPhone 17 Pro、AirPods Pro 3、纸巾和坚果。他向三个AI助手询问最便宜的店铺和价格。", "这些AI助手给出的价格都是真的。但有些店铺卖的是二手或已拆封的iPhone。还有一个助手把他引到了一家不在他所在城市销售的店铺。", "一个叫灵光的新AI帮他盯价格。当iPhone价格降到约7259元时，它发来了消息。", "这位记者说，AI能省钱。但AI也必须说清楚它找到的是什么性质的商品。"], "body": "The reporter wanted an iPhone 17 Pro, AirPods Pro 3, tissues and nuts. He asked three AI helpers for the cheapest shop and price.\n\nThe AI helpers gave real prices. But some shops sold used or opened iPhones. One helper sent him to a shop that did not sell in his city.\n\nA new AI called Lingguang watched prices for him. It sent a message when the iPhone price fell to about 7259 yuan.\n\nThe reporter said AI can save money. But AI must also say what kind of product it finds.", "body_zh": "这位记者想买iPhone 17 Pro、AirPods Pro 3、纸巾和坚果。他向三个AI助手询问最便宜的店铺和价格。\n\n这些AI助手给出的价格都是真的。但有些店铺卖的是二手或已拆封的iPhone。还有一个助手把他引到了一家不在他所在城市销售的店铺。\n\n一个叫灵光的新AI帮他盯价格。当iPhone价格降到约7259元时，它发来了消息。\n\n这位记者说，AI能省钱。但AI也必须说清楚它找到的是什么性质的商品。", "text": "The reporter wanted an iPhone 17 Pro, AirPods Pro 3, tissues and nuts. He asked three AI helpers for the cheapest shop and price. The AI helpers gave real prices. But some shops sold used or opened iPhones. One helper sent him to a shop that did not sell in his city. A new AI called Lingguang watched prices for him. It sent a message when the iPhone price fell to about 7259 yuan. The reporter said AI can save money. But AI must also say what kind of product it finds.", "vocab": [{"word": "price", "pos": "noun", "zh": "价格", "note": "常用词，问价时说 the price", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "shop", "pos": "noun", "zh": "店铺", "note": "线上线下的店都可以用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cheap", "pos": "adj", "zh": "便宜的", "note": "反义词是 expensive", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "ask", "pos": "verb", "zh": "询问", "note": "ask someone for something", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "find", "pos": "verb", "zh": "找到", "note": "过去式是 found", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "send", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发送", "note": "send a message 发消息", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "used", "pos": "adj", "zh": "二手的", "note": "used phone 二手手机", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "save money", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "省钱", "note": "常见搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-0